  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/08/IMG_6814.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>248 fotos de la tarde y la noche de este viernes en la Feria Medieval de Onda, que contin&uacute;a hasta el domingo en el castillo y en el centro hist&oacute;rico, con m&uacute;ltiples actividades tanto en la fortaleza como en la Font de Dins y calles que unen ambos lugares.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendresfiramedieval16/img_6401.jpg\" alt=\"img_6401\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendresfiramedieval16/img_6402.jpg\" alt=\"img_6402\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendresfiramedieval16/img_6403.jpg\" alt=\"img_6403\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendresfiramedieval16/img_6404.jpg\" alt=\"img_6404\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendresfiramedieval16/img_6405.jpg\" alt=\"img_6405\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendresfiramedieval16/img_6406.jpg\" alt=\"img_6406\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendresfiramedieval16/img_6407.jpg\" alt=\"img_6407\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendresfiramedieval16/img_6408.jpg\" alt=\"img_6408\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendresfiramedieval16/img_6409.jpg\" alt=\"img_6409\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8